OL,3,GNEWSAYoung islanders invited to share
OL,4,Aviews on housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FYoung people living away from Guernsey
OL,7,Fare being encouraged to share their
OL,8,Fthoughts on the island's housing and
OL,9,Fwhether it affects their decision to
OL,10,Freturn.
OL,12,FThe States of Guernsey said the Young
OL,13,FPeople's Housing Forum would offer a
OL,14,Fyoung perspective in an inclusive space
OL,15,Fto talk about experiences, priorities
OL,16,Fand ideas.
OL,18,FIts role is to help the Committee for
OL,19,FHousing understand how availability,
OL,20,Faffordability and suitability affect
OL,21,Fyoung people's willingness to live,
OL,22,Fstudy, work or return to Guernsey.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
