OL,3,GNEWSAYoung islanders invited to share
OL,4,Aviews on housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommittee president Steve Williams
OL,7,Fsaid: "If we want young people to see
OL,8,Ftheir future in Guernsey, we need to
OL,9,Funderstand what they're experiencing
OL,10,Fnow."
